    ('e9cc400a-669d-5e62-ae44-6acd06b49bdc', '1. Prepared the Infra Registry and matching it to our database schema', 'TASK', '15e63811-b35b-5c3f-943e-585e1ebdeb2d', 'Yogita', '2026-09-01 00:00:00', '2026-09-30 00:00:00', 'DOING', 1, false, NULL, '{}', NULL, 'Remarks: Scope Of Phase 1 for Infra Registry Management 
1. Only Entry of record will be from RC ADMIN, So for all records currently getting entered will be in a APPROVED state as per workflow.
2. All "Approved" records across application will be displayed to SAI HO. (So may be no work flow engine required this point)
