4. RC ADMIN will see all related data entered within scope with STATUS.

Workflow Engine to be incorporated later.
Remarks from the SAI team: BRD to be finalized by 7 Aug 2026
User Stories to be created by 10 Aug 2026
Design is in In Progress, First Draft to be shared by 7 Aug 2026
